  <div id="nutritionView" class="app-view">
    <main class="container">
      
      <!-- INTERACTIVE TDEE & MACRO CALCULATOR -->
      <div class="macro-calc-box">
        <div class="pro-section-head" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">
            <h2>⚡ Precision Macro & Calorie Calculator</h2>
            <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--emerald); font-weight: 700; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
              Mifflin-St Jeor Clinical Formula
            </span>
          </div>
          <p>Fine-tune your daily calorie and macronutrient requirements according to your current weight, activity level, and body composition objective.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="calc-grid">
          <div class="calc-input-group">
            <label>Current Bodyweight (kg)</label>
            <input type="number" id="calcWeight" min="50" max="150" step="0.5" value="82.0" oninput="calculateMacros()">
          </div>
          <div class="calc-input-group">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px;">
              <label style="margin-bottom: 0;">Primary Fitness Goal</label>
              <div class="quick-goal-chips" style="display: flex; gap: 4px;">
                <button type="button" class="goal-chip active" id="chipGoalRecomp" onclick="selectQuickGoal('recomp')">⚡ Recomp</button>
                <button type="button" class="goal-chip" id="chipGoalBulk" onclick="selectQuickGoal('bulk')">💪 Bulk</button>
                <button type="button" class="goal-chip" id="chipGoalCut" onclick="selectQuickGoal('cut')">🔥 Cut</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <select id="calcGoal" onchange="syncQuickGoal(); calculateMacros()">
              <option value="recomp" selected>Body Recomposition (Lose Fat + Build Muscle)</option>
              <option value="bulk">Lean Hypertrophy (+250 kcal surplus)</option>
              <option value="cut">Fat Loss & Muscle Retention (-500 kcal deficit)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-input-group">
            <label>Daily Activity Profile</label>
            <select id="calcActivity" onchange="calculateMacros()">
              <option value="1.35" selected>Sedentary Desk Job + Aethos 365 Home Workouts</option>
              <option value="1.45">Lightly Active (8,000 daily steps + Workouts)</option>
              <option value="1.6">Moderately Active (12,000 steps + Workouts)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="macro-stat-cards">
          <div class="macro-stat-card macro-card-cals">
            <div class="m-num" id="calcCalories" style="color: var(--cyan); text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);">2,420</div>
            <div class="m-label" style="color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700;">Daily Calories (kcal)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="macro-stat-card macro-card-prot">
            <div class="m-num" id="calcProtein" style="color: var(--emerald); text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);">164g</div>
            <div class="m-label" style="color: #34d399; font-weight: 700;">Protein (2.0g/kg)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="macro-stat-card macro-card-carbs">
            <div class="m-num" id="calcCarbs" style="color: var(--purple); text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.4);">275g</div>
            <div class="m-label" style="color: #c084fc; font-weight: 700;">Carbohydrates</div>
          </div>
          <div class="macro-stat-card macro-card-fats">
            <div class="m-num" id="calcFats" style="color: var(--amber); text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);">74g</div>
            <div class="m-label" style="color: #fbbf24; font-weight: 700;">Healthy Fats</div>
          </div>
          <div class="macro-stat-card macro-card-water">
            <div class="m-num" id="calcWater" style="color: #38bdf8; text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);">3.4L</div>
            <div class="m-label" style="color: #60a5fa; font-weight: 700;">Hydration Target</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 14px;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 4px;">
            <span>Macro Distribution:</span>
            <span id="macroRatioSummary">Protein 27% • Carbs 46% • Fats 27%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="macro-bar-wrap">
            <div class="macro-bar-p" id="macroBarP" style="width: 27%;"></div>
            <div class="macro-bar-c" id="macroBarC" style="width: 46%;"></div>
            <div class="macro-bar-f" id="macroBarF" style="width: 27%;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pro-section-card">
        <div class="pro-section-head">
          <h2>🥗 The 35-Year-Old Muscle & Joint Nutrition Blueprint</h2>
          <p>At 35 years old and 6'0", training without proper nutrition leads to joint fatigue and zero muscle growth. Fuel your body with the exact science of protein synthesis, hydration, and anti-inflammatory whole foods.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="diet-switcher">
          <button class="diet-btn active" onclick="switchDiet('omnivore')">🍗 Non-Vegetarian (Omnivore)</button>
          <button class="diet-btn" onclick="switchDiet('eggetarian')">🍳 Eggetarian (Eggs + Dairy)</button>
          <button class="diet-btn" onclick="switchDiet('vegetarian')">🌱 Pure Vegetarian / Indian Plant-Forward</button>
        </div>

        <div class="meal-timeline" id="mealTimelineContainer"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pre & Post Workout Timing Window -->
      <div class="pro-section-card">
        <div class="pro-section-head">
          <h2>⏰ Pre & Post-Workout Nutrient Timing (The Muscle Growth Windows)</h2>
          <p>Maximize energy during your workout and accelerate tendon repair immediately after.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
          <div style="background: var(--bg-card); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 4px solid var(--amber);">
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--amber); text-transform: uppercase;">60–90 Mins Pre-Workout</div>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 6px 0;">Sustained Muscle Glycogen</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
              <strong>What to eat:</strong> 1 ripe banana + 1 tablespoon peanut butter OR 1 cup oatmeal with a scoop of protein.<br>
              <strong>Why:</strong> Easily digestible complex carbs top off liver and muscle glycogen so you don't experience dizzy fatigue on heavy sets.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background: var(--bg-card); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 4px solid var(--cyan);">
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--cyan); text-transform: uppercase;">Intra-Workout (During Sets)</div>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 6px 0;">Cellular Hydration & Electrolytes</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
              <strong>What to drink:</strong> 750ml water + 1/4 teaspoon Himalayan pink salt + squeeze of lemon.<br>
              <strong>Why:</strong> Sodium is the primary electrolyte responsible for muscle contraction. A 2% dehydration drop cuts strength by 15%.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background: var(--bg-card); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border-left: 4px solid var(--emerald);">
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--emerald); text-transform: uppercase;">Within 60 Mins Post-Workout</div>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 6px 0;">Anabolic Repair & Leucine Trigger</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
              <strong>What to eat:</strong> 35g–40g Protein + 40g Fast Carbs (e.g. Whey shake + Greek yogurt/eggs + white rice or fruit).<br>
              <strong>Why:</strong> Initiates Muscle Protein Synthesis (MPS) and switches the body from a catabolic state to an anabolic rebuilding state.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Evidence-Based Supplements -->
      <div class="pro-section-card">
        <div class="pro-section-head">
          <h2>💊 Science-Backed Supplement Protocol (Zero Marketing Waste)</h2>
          <p>90% of fitness supplements are a waste of money. Here are the only 5 compounds clinically proven to benefit a 35yo trainee:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="supp-grid">
          <div class="supp-card">
            <span class="supp-tier tier-gold">Tier 1: Essential #1</span>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 4px 0 6px;">Creatine Monohydrate</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <strong>Dose:</strong> 5 grams daily (every day, any time with water).<br>
              <strong>Benefits:</strong> Increases intracellular phosphocreatine for 10–15% more strength on pushups & squats; draws water into muscle cells to protect joints.
