          </div>

          <div class="supp-card">
            <span class="supp-tier tier-gold">Tier 1: Essential #2</span>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 4px 0 6px;">Whey Protein Isolate</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <strong>Dose:</strong> 1–2 scoops daily (25g–50g protein).<br>
              <strong>Benefits:</strong> Richest source of Leucine (the amino acid that switches on muscle building). Extremely convenient for hitting daily 145g+ targets.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="supp-card">
            <span class="supp-tier tier-green">Tier 2: Joint & Longevity</span>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 4px 0 6px;">Omega-3 Fish Oil (EPA/DHA)</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <strong>Dose:</strong> 1,500mg–2,000mg combined EPA + DHA daily with meals.<br>
              <strong>Benefits:</strong> Reduces chronic tendon inflammation, lubricates long 6ft leg joints, and accelerates post-exercise soreness recovery.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="supp-card">
            <span class="supp-tier tier-green">Tier 2: Hormone Health</span>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 4px 0 6px;">Vitamin D3 + K2</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <strong>Dose:</strong> 2,000 to 4,000 IU daily with morning breakfast.<br>
              <strong>Benefits:</strong> Supports natural testosterone production, bone density, and immune defense in males over 30 working indoor desk jobs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="supp-card">
            <span class="supp-tier tier-green">Tier 2: Deep Sleep</span>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; margin: 4px 0 6px;">Magnesium Glycinate</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
              <strong>Dose:</strong> 300mg taken 45 minutes before sleep.<br>
